      "text": "\u00c8 uno scalo lungo.",
      "translation": "That is a long layover."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "Possiamo usare la sala d'attesa?",
      "translation": "Can we use the waiting hall?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "S\u00ec, c'\u00e8 anche un caff\u00e9 l\u00e0.",
